{"id":"c6e0d4fd97c5ef41","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-filter-nonprincipal-filter.md","title":"ZFC Filter Nonprincipal Filter","display":"df-zfc-filter-nonprincipal-filter — ZFC Filter Nonprincipal Filter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-filter-nonprincipal-filter","aliases":["58-df-zfc-filter-nonprincipal-filter"],"display":"df-zfc-filter-nonprincipal-filter — ZFC Filter Nonprincipal Filter","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-filter-nonprincipal-filter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-filter-nonprincipal-filter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-filter-nonprincipal-filter — ZFC Filter Nonprincipal Filter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d1121e6ff027ff98\" href=\"?note=d1121e6ff027ff98\" title=\"58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter\">58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,X\\in V\">\\(F,X\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilterNonprincipalFilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilterNonprincipalFilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S\\)</span> (proper-filter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d1121e6ff027ff98\" href=\"?note=d1121e6ff027ff98\" title=\"58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter\">58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter\\text{-}nonprincipal\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilterNonprincipalFilter}_S(F,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S(F,X)\\land\\neg\\exists A\\subseteq X\\;\\bigl(F=\\{B\\subseteq X\\mid A\\subseteq B\\}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter\\text{-}nonprincipal\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilterNonprincipalFilter}_S(F,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S(F,X)\\land\\neg\\exists A\\subseteq X\\;\\bigl(F=\\{B\\subseteq X\\mid A\\subseteq B\\}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A principal filter may be generated by an arbitrary subset <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq X\">\\(A\\subseteq X\\)</span>, not only by a point; the former test therefore mislabeled filters generated by larger sets as nonprincipal.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter","status":"resolved","id":"d1121e6ff027ff98","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter","status":"resolved","id":"d1121e6ff027ff98","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S$ (proper-filter predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"F,X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilterNonprincipalFilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter\\text{-}nonprincipal\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilterNonprincipalFilter}_S(F,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S(F,X)\\land\\neg\\exists A\\subseteq X\\;\\bigl(F=\\{B\\subseteq X\\mid A\\subseteq B\\}\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"A\\subseteq X","display":false}],"bytes":1103,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1877","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-filter-nonprincipal-filter.md|58-df-zfc-filter-nonprincipal-filter]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d1121e6ff027ff98"]}